sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Admin User
    participant Page as AdminTenantDetail
    participant Modal as Confirmation Modal
    participant API as PATCH /internal/tenants/:id/...
    participant State as Page State

    Note over Admin,State: === SUSPEND FLOW ===

    Admin->>Page: Click "Suspend" button
    Page->>Modal: Open modal with default type = hard

    Admin->>Modal: Select suspend type via radio buttons
    Note over Modal: Hard suspend: deactivates account,<br/>blocks wallets + transfers + API.<br/>Soft suspend: blocks new activations<br/>only, existing wallets stay live.

    alt Admin cancels
        Admin->>Modal: Click "Cancel" or press Escape
        Modal->>Page: Close modal, no action
    else Admin confirms
        Admin->>Modal: Click "Hard suspend tenant" or "Soft suspend tenant"
        Modal->>Page: Close modal, trigger submitStatusAction("suspend")

        Page->>Page: Set suspendBusy = true
        Page->>API: PATCH /api/v1/internal/tenants/:id/suspend<br/>{ type: "hard" | "soft" }

        alt 401 Unauthorized
            API-->>Page: 401
            Page->>State: logout() - clear session, redirect
        else Error response
            API-->>Page: { error: "..." }
            Page-->>Admin: Show suspend error message
        else Success
            API-->>Page: 200 OK
            Page->>State: Trigger load() to refresh
            State->>API: GET /internal/tenants/:id/billing
            API-->>State: Updated tenant data
            State-->>Admin: Render updated status (Suspended / Soft-suspended)
        end
    end

    Note over Admin,State: === UNSUSPEND FLOW ===

    Admin->>Page: Click "Unsuspend" button
    Page->>Modal: Open modal (action = unsuspend)

    Note over Modal: Shows: "Full wallet and API access<br/>will be restored immediately."

    alt Admin cancels
        Admin->>Modal: Click "Cancel" or press Escape
        Modal->>Page: Close modal, no action
    else Admin confirms
        Admin->>Modal: Click "Unsuspend tenant"
        Modal->>Page: Close modal, trigger submitStatusAction("unsuspend")

        Page->>Page: Set suspendBusy = true
        Page->>API: PATCH /api/v1/internal/tenants/:id/unsuspend

        alt 401 Unauthorized
            API-->>Page: 401
            Page->>State: logout() - clear session, redirect
        else Error response
            API-->>Page: { error: "..." }
            Page-->>Admin: Show unsuspend error message
        else Success
            API-->>Page: 200 OK
            Page->>State: Trigger load() to refresh
            State->>API: GET /internal/tenants/:id/billing
            API-->>State: Updated tenant data
            State-->>Admin: Render updated status (Active)
        end
    end
